<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 54,569 bags in latest week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 54,569 bags in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 54,569 bags in the week ending December 15 compared to 87,592 bags in the corresponding week to December 17 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said in a statement.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,395,766 bags against 1,873,793 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
